/// alongside the by-value and borrowed ones.** Rust does NOT chain
/// [`TryFrom`] impls — a `T: TryFrom<&Vec<u8>>` bound is NOT satisfied
/// by `T: TryFrom<&[u8]>` alone or by `T: TryFrom<Vec<u8>>` alone,
